违规已记入账号违规记录（违规次数 +1）。累计违规 3 次，账号将被永久禁止部署服务。","content":"<p>前几天领的赛博鸡蛋 &lt;a data-unique-id=&quot;mwsqifgc-m3wlmz&quot; href=&quot;https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&amp;amp;mid=2651703579&amp;amp;idx=3&amp;amp;sn=aa83f5b90015ed8783ecdf65e0d312e7&amp;amp;scene=142&amp;amp;poc_token=HIC5A2ujwXMRhMntTyzDJgL91fLBoEw2uyBeuzBi#wechat_redirect&quot; class=&quot;normal_text_link mp_article_text_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-itemshowtype=&quot;0&quot;&gt;赛博领鸡蛋：免费云端 AI Agent&lt;/a&gt; 已碎&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;1&quot; data-refer=&quot;图1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图1&lt;/a&gt;<br /><br />我给他的任务是每日收集安全漏洞&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;3&quot; data-refer=&quot;图3&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图3&lt;/a&gt;...<br /><br />[捂脸]<br /><br />经平台安全系统检测，您的沙箱实例 qwenpaw-sbs-prod-hjl8q 存在以下违规行为：<br /><br />1. 【渗透工具利用行为】2026-11-20 09:02<br /> 进程：/usr/bin/curl<br /> 命令行：curl -s -m 25 -A Mozilla/5.0 https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=CVE-2026-123890+vCenter<br /><br />上述行为已违反《平台使用规范》。根据平台违规处理机制，我们已对您的账号执行以下处置：<br /><br />1. 实例终止：涉事沙箱实例已删除停用；<br />2. 违规记录：本次违规已记入账号违规记录（违规次数 +1）。累计违规 3 次，账号将被永久禁止部署服务。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxe1UTmJfnmaFbVseB7piaUIfsM0XaHRpzucpBQ2hCNvhoTSshicsfsFSVJT2a5YNibAYMma6Dq3WREAIQZmzcGTTk4ncMQBKedsI8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxe0yTpZQZtGJ4godVGPAYduPZOduvNter218PY8icMKTGB1bKn6J8njBJVzycGFgJK0vUJzrj101AiaIeWWtyicLrd5WtJBRhLv3I%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxerz3apG7PFCyXcmTx8G6CzNns8AEicHVWeRuepDxDgmMM43iaf5QEbu2qwxjuzh0ticeh66TkulU5IpjXBA4GGR1rAxZ7vPMyHFM%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%